# ThreadSanitizer suppressions, which .github/workflows/tsan.yml passes in
# TSAN_OPTIONS (suppressions=tests/tsan.supp). Each says why it is not a race.
#
# trading::SharedVector and SharedMap hand a node to a writer once it holds the
# only reference: use_count() == 1, then an acquire fence that pairs with the
# release in the last other owner's decrement (shared_detail::unique in
# include/openport/trading/shared.hpp). ThreadSanitizer does not model standalone
# fences, so it reports that writer's first write against the other owner's
# earlier reads. Reports with either container in a stack are suppressed.
race:openport::trading::SharedVector
race:openport::trading::SharedMap
